  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Border Security in Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will contribute to strengthened border security by improving the Government of Kazakhstan&apos;s capacity to address border crimes in Kazakhstan. Proposed activities will focus on support to the Government&apos;s efforts toward better questioned travel document verification, enhancement of identification of suspicious containers entering the Sea Ports of the country and technical support to the operations of K-9 Units.</narrative>
  </description>
